# Gradle build output and caches - ANY module, any depth.
# These rules live at the root on purpose: sstvaf/.gitignore only protects
# sstvaf/, so a stray module directory (the old ft8af/ carried ~2.6k committed
# class files, jars and gradle caches before it was removed) had nothing
# covering it. Trailing slashes keep build.gradle / build.gradle.kts tracked.
.gradle/
build/
